Explain the remedy via model averaging (MA) and specify the concrete MA update used by the authors: model averaging is implemented as an exponential moving average of parameters after an epoch $t_0$;
$$
\theta_{t+1}^{\mathrm{MA}}=\begin{cases}
\theta_t, & t<t_0,\\[4pt]
\tau\cdot \theta_t^{\mathrm{MA}} + (1-\tau)\cdot \theta_{t+1}, & t\ge t_0,
\end{cases}
$$
with decay $\tau=\dfrac{t-t_0}{t-t_0+1}$ in the implementation; here $\theta_t$ denotes the online parameters at epoch $t$ and $\theta_t^{\mathrm{MA}}$ denotes the running averaged parameters.
